# `pnpm release:promote X.Y.Z` (scripts/release-promote-linear.mjs) to move
# vX.Y.Z-labeled Linear issues from "In Github" → "In TestFlight" after
# a TestFlight build goes live. Personal key from
# https://linear.app/settings/account/security.
LINEAR_API_KEY=lin_api_...

# NevarMail — the transport for all outbound email (#1389): notifications,
# team and worker invites from the Supabase edge functions, and the marketing
# contact form. Each kind of mail is a NevarMail "use case" with its own
# sender on mail.scaffald.com; the edge functions read the use case ids from
# their secrets (NEVARMAIL_USE_CASE_NOTIFICATIONS, _TEAM_INVITES,
# _REFERRAL_INVITES), the contact form from EAS (scripts/set-nevarmail-eas-env.sh).
#
# The key has to be set in three places, which are separate runtimes and do
# NOT share secrets:
#   1. here, for local dev
#   2. Supabase edge function secrets  (notification and invite email)
#   3. EAS Hosting environment         (the /api/contact route)
NEVARMAIL_API_KEY=...
NEVARMAIL_USE_CASE_CONTACT=
# NEVARMAIL_BASE_URL=https://app.nevarmail.com

# Resend is being retired (#1391); nothing in the app reads RESEND_API_KEY.
# Optional override for where contact form submissions go:
# CONTACT_FORM_TO=hello@scaffald.com
